>New potion: Potion of Alka-Seltzer.  Un-Satiates you.  Goes well with
>dragon corpses.  Message when drinking would be ``This tastes fizzy.''
>Blessed/normal/cursed affects degree of hunger you feel after quaffing
>(maybe cursed has the opposite effect, e.g. ``You feel bloated.'').

I don't think Alka-seltzer would help against choking on too much food,
though -- it just helps against the symptoms, not the cause.  I'd prefer:

(**minor spoiler**)
Potion of Ipecac: induces vomiting.  Blessed ipecac only immbolizes you
for one round; cursed ipecac for much longer...much like rotten food,
actually, but no chance of spoilage.

